1
00:00:00,062 --> 00:00:01,992
(Amy:)Sheldon, it's a routine
procedure.

2
00:00:01,997 --> 00:00:04,067
(Amy:)I've heard you complain
about his snoring.

3
00:00:04,066 --> 00:00:06,336
We... Yes, for the first
five or six years,

4
00:00:06,334 --> 00:00:08,234
(Sheldon:)but I've gotten used to it.

5
00:00:08,904 --> 00:00:10,234
(Sheldon:)It helps me sleep.

6
00:00:10,238 --> 00:00:12,808
(Sheldon:)He's like my mucus-powered
white noise machine.

7
00:00:14,176 --> 00:00:16,006
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I'm gonna get
the surgery, it's no big deal.

8
00:00:16,011 --> 00:00:17,181
(Leonard:)End of story.

9
00:00:17,179 --> 00:00:19,209
(Sheldon:)Very well.
I'm done talking about it.

10
00:00:19,214 --> 00:00:21,044
(Leonard:)Thank you.
I believe it was
your turn in the game.

11
00:00:21,049 --> 00:00:22,319
(Amy:)Okay.

12
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:25,349
(Sheldon:)Let's see...

13
00:00:25,353 --> 00:00:28,023
(Sheldon:)Oh, this person is most famous

14
00:00:28,023 --> 00:00:29,353
(Sheldon:)for never having gotten

15
00:00:29,357 --> 00:00:32,227
(Sheldon:)his nose mutilated
with elective surgery

16
00:00:32,227 --> 00:00:34,727
(Sheldon:)and never living the rest
of his life in the shadows

17
00:00:34,729 --> 00:00:36,329
(Sheldon:)as a hideous, disfigured freak.

18
00:00:38,033 --> 00:00:40,033
(Leonard:)I think you could
give a better clue.

19
00:00:40,035 --> 00:00:41,235
(Sheldon:)I don't.

20
00:00:41,236 --> 00:00:44,266
(Sheldon:)I'm not even sure if
that's a person or a typo.

21
00:00:45,707 --> 00:00:49,047
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

